# Pairs with OriginAuthenticated. The decision query keeps a body-declared
# requester instead of overwriting it with the stamped origin.
MODULE: ReceiverRequesterTakenFromBody
TARGET: OriginAuthenticated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: GetDecision acts for the requester its body names

--- FIND
         ELSE <<"ok", BoundOrigin(hdr)>>
--- REPLACE
         ELSE <<"ok", IF m \in RequesterQuery /\ body # NoBody THEN body ELSE BoundOrigin(hdr)>>
--- END